---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { getLocaleFromUrl, localizedPath, t } from "../../lib/i18n";
import { routeIds } from "../../lib/paths";

export const prerender = true;

const locale = getLocaleFromUrl(Astro.url);
const copy = t(locale);
const homeHref = localizedPath(locale, routeIds.home);
const storeHref = localizedPath(locale, routeIds.store);
const productHref = localizedPath(locale, routeIds.product);
const cartHref = localizedPath(locale, routeIds.cart);
const thumbs = ["bg-[url('/assets/pattern.png')] bg-cover bg-center", "bg-accent/30", "bg-secondary/30", "bg-primary/20"] as const;
const benefits = [copy.productBenefitDownload, copy.productBenefitAccess, copy.productBenefitFunds] as const;
const related = [
  { figure: "bg-primary/20", label: "portada", tag: "eBook", tagClass: "text-primary", swatch: "bg-primary", title: "Afrofuturismo latinoamericano", price: "US$ 9" },
  { figure: "bg-secondary/30", label: "lámina", tag: "Lámina", tagClass: "text-secondary", swatch: "bg-secondary", title: "Lámina · Reina Nzinga", price: "US$ 18" },
  { figure: "bg-accent/30", label: "camiseta", tag: "Merch", tagClass: "text-accent", swatch: "bg-accent", title: "Camiseta “Conocimiento = poder”", price: "US$ 22" },
] as const;
---

<BaseLayout title={copy.titleProduct} active="tienda">
  <div class="breadcrumbs text-sm">
    <ul>
      <li><a href={homeHref}>{copy.navHome}</a></li>
      <li><a href={storeHref}>{copy.navStore}</a></li>
      <li>Raíces</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 items-start gap-9 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <div>
      <figure class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] shadow">
        <div class="aspect-[4/3] bg-[url('/assets/pattern.png')] bg-cover bg-center"></div>
        <span class="badge badge-sm absolute bottom-3 left-3">portada del eBook</span>
      </figure>
      <div class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-4 gap-2.5">
        {thumbs.map((thumb) => <div class:list={["aspect-square overflow-hidden rounded-box", thumb]}></div>)}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[11.5px] font-extrabold tracking-[0.1em] text-secondary uppercase">
        <span class="size-2.5 rounded-[3px] bg-secondary"></span>
        eBook · PDF + EPUB
      </span>
      <h1 class="font-display mt-2.5 mb-3 text-[32px] font-bold lg:text-[34px]">Raíces: historia afro de Abya Yala</h1>
      <div class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5">
        <div class="rating rating-sm">
          <div class="mask mask-star-2 bg-secondary" aria-label="1 star"></div>
          <div class="mask mask-star-2 bg-secondary" aria-label="2 star"></div>
          <div class="mask mask-star-2 bg-secondary" aria-label="3 star"></div>
          <div class="mask mask-star-2 bg-secondary" aria-label="4 star"></div>
          <div class="mask mask-star-2 bg-secondary" aria-label="5 star" aria-current="true"></div>
        </div>
        <span class="text-sm font-bold opacity-60">{copy.productReviews}</span>
      </div>
      <p class="font-display text-[30px] font-extrabold">US$ 12 <span class="text-base font-semibold opacity-50 line-through">US$ 18</span></p>
      <p class="mt-3.5 mb-[18px] text-[15.5px] leading-[1.65] opacity-80">
        Quinientos años de historia contados desde la diáspora: de los reinos africanos al cimarronaje y al presente afrolatino. 214 páginas, con mapas, líneas de tiempo y guía de lectura.
      </p>
      <div class="card bg-base-200 mb-[18px] shadow">
        <div class="card-body py-4">
          <ul class="list">
            {
              benefits.map((item) => (
                <li class="list-row">
                  <span class="badge badge-soft badge-accent">✓</span>
                  <span>{item}</span>
                </li>
              ))
            }
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
        <div class="join">
          <button class="btn join-item" type="button" data-qty="-">−</button>
          <span class="btn join-item no-animation pointer-events-none" data-qty-value>1</span>
          <button class="btn join-item" type="button" data-qty="+">+</button>
        </div>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href={cartHref}>
          <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <use href="#ic-bag"></use>
          </svg>
          {copy.productAddCart}
        </a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href={cartHref}>{copy.productBuyNow}</a>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-3.5 text-[12.5px] opacity-60">🔒 {copy.productSecure}</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div role="tablist" class="tabs tabs-border mt-11">
    <button class="tab tab-active" role="tab" type="button">{copy.productTabDesc}</button>
    <button class="tab" role="tab" type="button">{copy.productTabDetails}</button>
    <button class="tab" role="tab" type="button">{copy.productTabReviews}</button>
  </div>
  <div class="max-w-[720px] py-[22px] text-[15.5px] leading-[1.7] opacity-80">
    <p>“Raíces” recorre la historia que los manuales dejaron fuera: los imperios de Mali y el Gran Zimbabue, la travesía forzada, los palenques y quilombos como proyectos de libertad, y las luchas y aportes afro que construyeron América Latina.</p>
    <p class="mt-4">Escrito en lenguaje claro y acompañado de fuentes, es ideal para autodidactas, docentes y círculos de lectura.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-6 mb-5 flex items-end justify-between gap-4">
    <h2 class="font-display text-[26px] font-bold">{copy.productRelated}</h2>
    <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" href={storeHref}>
      {copy.productSeeStore}
      <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
        <use href="#ic-arrow"></use>
      </svg>
    </a>
  </div>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
    {
      related.map((item) => (
        <article class="card bg-base-200 shadow">
          <a href={productHref}>
            <figure class:list={["relative aspect-[4/3]", item.figure]}>
              {item.label ? <span class="badge badge-sm absolute bottom-3 left-3">{item.label}</span> : null}
            </figure>
          </a>
          <div class="card-body">
            <span class:list={["inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[11.5px] font-extrabold tracking-[0.1em] uppercase", item.tagClass]}>
              <span class:list={["size-2.5 rounded-[3px]", item.swatch]}></span>
              {item.tag}
            </span>
            <h3 class="card-title font-display">
              <a href={productHref}>{item.title}</a>
            </h3>
            <div class="card-actions mt-auto items-center justify-between">
              <span class="font-display text-xl font-extrabold">{item.price}</span>
              <a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" href={cartHref}>{copy.storeAdd}</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      ))
    }
  </div>

  <div class="indicator fixed right-5 bottom-24 z-40 lg:bottom-6">
    <span class="indicator-item badge badge-accent badge-sm">2</span>
    <a class="btn btn-neutral" href={cartHref}>
      <svg width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
        <use href="#ic-bag"></use>
      </svg>
      {copy.storeCart}
    </a>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  const value = document.querySelector("[data-qty-value]");
  document.querySelectorAll("[data-qty]").forEach((button) => {
    button.addEventListener("click", () => {
      const current = Number(value?.textContent || "1");
      const next = button.getAttribute("data-qty") === "+" ? current + 1 : Math.max(1, current - 1);
      if (value) value.textContent = String(next);
    });
  });
</script>
